{"seq":2,"slug":"statistical-analysis","title":"统计分析与概率编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/julia-scientific-computing/data-visualization/statistical-analysis","wordCount":1228,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"统计分析与概率编程\">统计分析与概率编程</h1><p>Julia 的统计生态建立在一个关键设计决策之上：<code>Distribution</code> 抽象类型通过多重派发使得同一段统计代码——无论是拟合、采样还是假设检验——自动适配连续分布、离散分布、多元分布、甚至用户自定义的混合分布。Distributions.jl 定义了统一接口，而 Turing.jl 将其推向概率编程的前沿——用 Julia 原生语法编写贝叶斯模型，由框架自动完成高效的后验推断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Julia 统计生态建立在一个抽象类型之上：<code>Distribution</code>。每个概率分布都是一个类型实例，<code>mean</code>、<code>pdf</code>、<code>cdf</code>、<code>quantile</code>、<code>rand</code>、<code>fit</code> 等操作通过多重派发分发到各分布的最优实现——于是同一段统计代码无需分支即可适配连续、离散、多元乃至用户自定义的混合分布。这条主线向上延伸出概率编程：Turing.jl 用 <code>@model</code> 宏把先验与似然的声明编译为对数密度函数，再由 NUTS/HMC、Gibbs 或 ADVI 完成推断，而其技术优势在于 <code>@model</code> 块内<strong>是标准 Julia 代码而非 DSL</strong>，任意控制流都可表达，Stan 等编译型 PPL 则需特殊语法。在此之上，一次完整的贝叶斯分析不止「拟合-报告后验均值」，还包括先验预测检查、模型比较（WAIC/LOO-CV）与后验预测检查；而经典回归（GLM.jl）与微分方程的嵌入则说明统计并非孤立——它与 ODE 求解器共享同一套可组合性基础设施。下文沿 Distributions 接口、假设检验、Turing 概率编程、贝叶斯工作流、GLM 与生态集成逐层展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"distributions-jl-统一概率接口\">Distributions.jl：统一概率接口</h2><p>Distributions.jl 为 100+ 种概率分布提供了一致的 API。每个分布是一个类型实例，所有操作通过多重派发分发到最优实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"using Distributions, Random&#10;&#10;# 构造分布对象&#10;d_normal = Normal(0.0, 1.0)&#10;d_gamma = Gamma(2.0, 0.5)&#10;d_mv = MvNormal([0.0, 0.0], [1.0 0.3; 0.3 1.0])&#10;&#10;# 统一接口：适用于所有分布&#10;mean(d_normal)       # 0.0&#10;var(d_gamma)         # 0.5&#10;pdf(d_normal, 0.5)   # 概率密度&#10;cdf(d_normal, 1.96)  # 累积分布&#10;quantile(d_normal, 0.975)  # 分位数&#10;&#10;# 随机采样&#10;samples = rand(d_normal, 10_000)&#10;&#10;# 最大似然估计：从数据拟合分布&#10;data = rand(LogNormal(1.0, 0.5), 1000)&#10;fitted = fit(LogNormal, data)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using Distributions, Random</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 构造分布对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>d_normal = Normal(0.0, 1.0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>d_gamma = Gamma(2.0, 0.5)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>d_mv = MvNormal([0.0, 0.0], [1.0 0.3; 0.3 1.0])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 统一接口：适用于所有分布</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>mean(d_normal)       # 0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>var(d_gamma)         # 0.5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pdf(d_normal, 0.5)   # 概率密度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>cdf(d_normal, 1.96)  # 累积分布</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>quantile(d_normal, 0.975)  # 分位数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 随机采样</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>samples = rand(d_normal, 10_000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 最大似然估计：从数据拟合分布</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data = rand(LogNormal(1.0, 0.5), 1000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fitted = fit(LogNormal, data)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分布族</th>\n<th>典型分布</th>\n<th>参数维度</th>\n<th>应用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>连续单变量</td>\n<td>Normal, Gamma, Beta, LogNormal</td>\n<td>1-3</td>\n<td>基础建模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>离散单变量</td>\n<td>Poisson, Binomial, NegBinomial</td>\n<td>1-2</td>\n<td>计数数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多元连续</td>\n<td>MvNormal, MvLogNormal</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n + n(n+1)/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>联合分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>矩阵分布</td>\n<td>Wishart, InverseWishart</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n(n+1)/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>协方差先验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合模型</td>\n<td>MixtureModel</td>\n<td>组件数 × 参数</td>\n<td>聚类</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"假设检验与统计推断\">假设检验与统计推断</h2><p>HypothesisTests.jl 提供经典统计检验，同样利用类型系统区分不同检验类型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"using HypothesisTests&#10;&#10;# 双样本 t 检验&#10;group_a = randn(50) .+ 0.3&#10;group_b = randn(50)&#10;result = UnequalVarianceTTest(group_a, group_b)&#10;println(&quot;p值: &quot;, pvalue(result))&#10;println(&quot;置信区间: &quot;, confint(result))&#10;&#10;# Kolmogorov-Smirnov 检验：样本是否来自特定分布&#10;ks = ExactOneSampleKSTest(samples, Normal(0, 1))&#10;&#10;# 卡方独立性检验&#10;observed = [45 35; 20 50]&#10;chi2 = ChisqTest(observed)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using HypothesisTests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 双样本 t 检验</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>group_a = randn(50) .+ 0.3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>group_b = randn(50)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>result = UnequalVarianceTTest(group_a, group_b)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>println(\"p值: \", pvalue(result))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>println(\"置信区间: \", confint(result))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Kolmogorov-Smirnov 检验：样本是否来自特定分布</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ks = ExactOneSampleKSTest(samples, Normal(0, 1))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 卡方独立性检验</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>observed = [45 35; 20 50]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>chi2 = ChisqTest(observed)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"turing-jl-概率编程\">Turing.jl：概率编程</h2><p>Turing.jl 是 Julia 的通用概率编程框架——用 <code>@model</code> 宏定义生成模型，支持 NUTS（No-U-Turn Sampler）、HMC、粒子滤波等推断算法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"using Turing, Distributions&#10;&#10;@model function linear_regression(x, y)&#10;    # 先验分布&#10;    α ~ Normal(0, 10)&#10;    β ~ Normal(0, 10)&#10;    σ ~ truncated(Normal(0, 5); lower=0)&#10;&#10;    # 似然&#10;    for i in eachindex(y)&#10;        y[i] ~ Normal(α + β * x[i], σ)&#10;    end&#10;end&#10;&#10;# 生成合成数据&#10;x_data = randn(100)&#10;y_data = 2.0 .+ 3.0 .* x_data .+ 0.5 .* randn(100)&#10;&#10;# 后验推断：NUTS 采样器&#10;model = linear_regression(x_data, y_data)&#10;chain = sample(model, NUTS(0.65), 2000)&#10;&#10;# 后验统计&#10;summarystats(chain)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using Turing, Distributions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@model function linear_regression(x, y)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    # 先验分布</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    α ~ Normal(0, 10)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    β ~ Normal(0, 10)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    σ ~ truncated(Normal(0, 5); lower=0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    # 似然</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for i in eachindex(y)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        y[i] ~ Normal(α + β * x[i], σ)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 生成合成数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>x_data = randn(100)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>y_data = 2.0 .+ 3.0 .* x_data .+ 0.5 .* randn(100)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 后验推断：NUTS 采样器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>model = linear_regression(x_data, y_data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>chain = sample(model, NUTS(0.65), 2000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 后验统计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>summarystats(chain)</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;@model 定义&lt;br/&gt;先验 + 似然&quot;] --&gt; B[编译为对数密度函数]&#10;    B --&gt; C{选择推断算法}&#10;    C --&gt;|连续参数| D[NUTS / HMC&lt;br/&gt;基于梯度的采样]&#10;    C --&gt;|混合离散/连续| E[Gibbs 复合采样器]&#10;    C --&gt;|近似推断| F[ADVI 变分推断]&#10;    D --&gt; G[自动微分&lt;br/&gt;ForwardDiff / ReverseDiff]&#10;    G --&gt; H[马尔可夫链&lt;br/&gt;后验样本]&#10;    H --&gt; I[诊断: Rhat, ESS, 迹图]&#10;    I --&gt; J[后验预测检查]\">graph TD\n    A[\"@model 定义&lt;br/&gt;先验 + 似然\"] --&gt; B[编译为对数密度函数]\n    B --&gt; C{选择推断算法}\n    C --&gt;|连续参数| D[NUTS / HMC&lt;br/&gt;基于梯度的采样]\n    C --&gt;|混合离散/连续| E[Gibbs 复合采样器]\n    C --&gt;|近似推断| F[ADVI 变分推断]\n    D --&gt; G[自动微分&lt;br/&gt;ForwardDiff / ReverseDiff]\n    G --&gt; H[马尔可夫链&lt;br/&gt;后验样本]\n    H --&gt; I[诊断: Rhat, ESS, 迹图]\n    I --&gt; J[后验预测检查]</pre><p>Turing.jl 的技术优势在于它<strong>不是 DSL</strong>——<code>@model</code> 块内是标准 Julia 代码，支持任意控制流（循环、条件、递归）。这使得层次模型、状态空间模型等复杂结构可以自然表达，而 Stan 等编译型 PPL 需要特殊语法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"贝叶斯工作流进阶\">贝叶斯工作流进阶</h2><p>实际贝叶斯分析远不止「拟合-报告后验均值」。完整的工作流包括先验预测检查、模型比较和后验预测：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"using Turing, StatsPlots&#10;&#10;# 层次模型：学校效应（8-schools 问题）&#10;@model function eight_schools(y, σ)&#10;    μ ~ Normal(0, 5)&#10;    τ ~ truncated(Cauchy(0, 5); lower=0)&#10;    θ ~ filldist(Normal(μ, τ), 8)&#10;&#10;    for i in 1:8&#10;        y[i] ~ Normal(θ[i], σ[i])&#10;    end&#10;end&#10;&#10;# 先验预测检查&#10;prior_chain = sample(eight_schools(fill(0.0, 8), fill(1.0, 8)),&#10;                     Prior(), 1000)&#10;&#10;# 模型比较：WAIC / LOO-CV&#10;using ParetoSmooth&#10;loo_result = psis_loo(model, chain)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using Turing, StatsPlots</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 层次模型：学校效应（8-schools 问题）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@model function eight_schools(y, σ)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    μ ~ Normal(0, 5)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    τ ~ truncated(Cauchy(0, 5); lower=0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    θ ~ filldist(Normal(μ, τ), 8)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for i in 1:8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        y[i] ~ Normal(θ[i], σ[i])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 先验预测检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>prior_chain = sample(eight_schools(fill(0.0, 8), fill(1.0, 8)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                     Prior(), 1000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 模型比较：WAIC / LOO-CV</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using ParetoSmooth</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>loo_result = psis_loo(model, chain)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>变分推断</strong>（ADVI）为大规模模型提供了快速近似替代——当 MCMC 需要数小时时，ADVI 可以在分钟内给出合理的后验近似：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"# 自动微分变分推断&#10;q = vi(model, ADVI(10, 5000))&#10;&#10;# 从变分后验采样&#10;vi_samples = rand(q, 1000)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 自动微分变分推断</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>q = vi(model, ADVI(10, 5000))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 从变分后验采样</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>vi_samples = rand(q, 1000)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"glm-与经典回归\">GLM 与经典回归</h2><p>对于标准统计模型，GLM.jl 提供了与 R 的 <code>glm()</code> 等价的接口——公式语法 + 分布族 + 链接函数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"using GLM, DataFrames&#10;&#10;df = DataFrame(&#10;    x1 = randn(200),&#10;    x2 = randn(200),&#10;    y = rand(200) .&gt; 0.5&#10;)&#10;&#10;# Logistic 回归&#10;model = glm(@formula(y ~ x1 + x2), df, Bernoulli(), LogitLink())&#10;println(coeftable(model))&#10;&#10;# 线性回归&#10;df.y_cont = 2.0 .* df.x1 .- 1.5 .* df.x2 .+ randn(200)&#10;lm_model = lm(@formula(y_cont ~ x1 + x2), df)&#10;r2(lm_model)  # R²\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using GLM, DataFrames</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>df = DataFrame(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    x1 = randn(200),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    x2 = randn(200),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    y = rand(200) .> 0.5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Logistic 回归</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>model = glm(@formula(y ~ x1 + x2), df, Bernoulli(), LogitLink())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>println(coeftable(model))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 线性回归</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>df.y_cont = 2.0 .* df.x1 .- 1.5 .* df.x2 .+ randn(200)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lm_model = lm(@formula(y_cont ~ x1 + x2), df)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>r2(lm_model)  # R²</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"与科学计算生态的集成\">与科学计算生态的集成</h2><p>统计分析不是孤立存在的——它与微分方程、优化紧密交织。Turing.jl 可以直接将 ODE 求解嵌入概率模型（贝叶斯 ODE 参数估计）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"using Turing, OrdinaryDiffEq&#10;&#10;@model function bayesian_ode(data, prob)&#10;    σ ~ InverseGamma(2, 3)&#10;    p ~ arraydist([Normal(10, 2), Normal(28, 5), Normal(2.5, 0.5)])&#10;&#10;    predicted = solve(remake(prob; p=p), Tsit5(); saveat=0.1)&#10;    for i in eachindex(data)&#10;        data[i] ~ Normal(predicted[1, i], σ)&#10;    end&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using Turing, OrdinaryDiffEq</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@model function bayesian_ode(data, prob)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    σ ~ InverseGamma(2, 3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    p ~ arraydist([Normal(10, 2), Normal(28, 5), Normal(2.5, 0.5)])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    predicted = solve(remake(prob; p=p), Tsit5(); saveat=0.1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for i in eachindex(data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        data[i] ~ Normal(predicted[1, i], σ)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种组合能力直接受益于 Julia 的可组合性——<a href=\"differential-equations\">微分方程求解</a>的求解器接受任何 <code>&lt;: Number</code> 类型参数，而 Turing 的采样器通过自动微分传播梯度信息穿过 ODE 求解过程，无需特殊适配代码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong><code>Distribution</code> 抽象类型统一了概率操作</strong>：每个分布是类型实例，<code>mean</code>/<code>pdf</code>/<code>cdf</code>/<code>quantile</code>/<code>fit</code> 经多重派发分发到 100+ 种分布的最优实现。</li>\n<li><strong>假设检验复用同一套类型分发</strong>：HypothesisTests.jl 用不同类型区分 t 检验、KS 检验、卡方检验，接口风格与分布操作一致。</li>\n<li><strong>Turing.jl 不是 DSL</strong>：<code>@model</code> 块内是标准 Julia 代码，支持任意控制流，因此层次模型、状态空间模型可以自然表达。</li>\n<li><strong>推断算法按参数类型选择</strong>：连续参数用 NUTS/HMC（基于梯度），混合离散/连续用 Gibbs 复合采样器，需要快速近似时用 ADVI 变分推断。</li>\n<li><strong>完整贝叶斯分析不止拟合</strong>：还需先验预测检查、模型比较（WAIC/LOO-CV）与后验预测检查，诊断指标包括 Rhat、ESS 与迹图。</li>\n<li><strong>强大的组合能力来自可组合性</strong>：贝叶斯 ODE 参数估计直接复用微分方程求解器，梯度自动穿过求解过程传播，无需适配代码。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"统计分析与概率编程","id":"统计分析与概率编程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Distributions.jl：统一概率接口","id":"distributions-jl-统一概率接口"},{"level":2,"text":"假设检验与统计推断","id":"假设检验与统计推断"},{"level":2,"text":"Turing.jl：概率编程","id":"turing-jl-概率编程"},{"level":2,"text":"贝叶斯工作流进阶","id":"贝叶斯工作流进阶"},{"level":2,"text":"GLM 与经典回归","id":"glm-与经典回归"},{"level":2,"text":"与科学计算生态的集成","id":"与科学计算生态的集成"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数据处理与 DataFrames","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/julia-scientific-computing/data-visualization/dataframes-processing"},"next":{"title":"可视化与绘图生态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/julia-scientific-computing/data-visualization/plotting-ecosystem"}}